# Coding Style — Стиль кода

## Активация

Применяется ко всем файлам `**/*.ts`, `**/*.tsx`.

---

## TypeScript

- Use strict types, avoid `any`
- Use Zod schemas for validation
- Export interfaces from `packages/shared`

```typescript
// ❌ Wrong
data: any

// ✅ Correct
data: Record<string, unknown>
data: UserDto
```

---

## NestJS (apps/api)

- One controller per resource
- Business logic in services only
- Use DTOs for request/response
- Use Swagger decorators

```typescript
// Controller pattern
@Controller('quests')
@ApiTags('Quests')
export class QuestsController {
  
  @Get()
  @UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard)
  @ApiBearerAuth()
  @ApiOperation({ summary: 'Get user quests' })
  @ApiResponse({ status: 200, type: [QuestDto] })
  async getQuests(@CurrentUser() user: JwtPayload) {
    return this.service.getQuests(user.sub);
  }
}
```

---

## Next.js (apps/web)

- Use App Router (`app/` directory)
- Client components: `'use client'` directive
- API calls through `lib/api.ts`
- Use TypeScript for all components

```typescript
// Component pattern
'use client';

import { useQuests } from '@/hooks/useQuests';

export function QuestList() {
  const { quests, isLoading } = useQuests();
  
  if (isLoading) return <Skeleton />;
  
  return (
    <ul>
      {quests.map(quest => (
        <QuestItem key={quest.id} quest={quest} />
      ))}
    </ul>
  );
}
```

---

## Error Handling

- НЕ игнорировать ошибки
- Use `NotFoundException`, `ForbiddenException`, etc.
- Check ownership before update/delete

```typescript
// ✅ Correct
async updateQuest(id: string, userId: string, data: UpdateQuestDto) {
  const quest = await this.prisma.quest.findUnique({ where: { id } });
  
  if (!quest) {
    throw new NotFoundException('Quest not found');
  }
  
  if (quest.userId !== userId) {
    throw new ForbiddenException('Not your quest');
  }
  
  return this.prisma.quest.update({ where: { id }, data });
}
```

---

## File Organization

| Тип файла | Расположение |
|-----------|--------------|
| Controllers | `apps/api/src/*/[name].controller.ts` |
| Services | `apps/api/src/*/[name].service.ts` |
| DTOs | `apps/api/src/common/dto/` |
| Guards | `apps/api/src/common/guards/` |
| Components | `apps/web/src/components/` |
| Pages | `apps/web/src/app/` |
| Hooks | `apps/web/src/hooks/` |
| API Client | `apps/web/src/lib/api.ts` |
